This fixture exercises phpc's deterministic buffered prepared-statement
result-binding island. System PHP needs a real initialized MySQLi/mysqlnd
connection and host database row source, while phpc binds direct object
property and object-property array-offset targets to the current deterministic
seed-post row. It does not implement true by-reference result aliases,
unbuffered statement fetching, arbitrary prepared SQL, host database state, PHP
warning/error fidelity, or native database lowering.
